    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.clue\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nMode arrays for clue triggers were only merged 2 days ago: https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.clue/commit/e2f0c1eb3ce652e34b1e9a9c504a780acf3bd4e3\n\nYet it's already listed in the main documentation as a starter example: https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-clue.html#miniclue-examples-fullstarterexample\n\nHere I am wondering why the hell I'm getting tracebacks.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nTry to use the starter example.",
