            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Using the `main` branch of any project is a pretty poor advice. Even though yours might work I am not going to hunt my plugins across main branches of various projects and be dealing with random breakage. The release concept exists for a reason.\n\nI am actually getting my neovim plugins from nix packages, which is even better than more traditional (neo)vim plugin distribution channels, but it lags behind even more than using your releases directly would.\n\nYour expectation of users quickly figuring things out from large amount of documentation text is wrong, it takes time and you add to the wasted time by increasing the confusion like this.",
